  "notes": [
    "`commit` pins the upstream SHA. Newer upstream commits removed the roadmap JSON files and stripped resource lists from content markdown, so keep this pin unless you have verified the new layout.",
    "include[] entries are carried forward from the previous disciplines.generated.json unless flagged `fetchFromUpstream: true` (React Flow JSON at `upstreamPath`) or `source: \"custom\"` (hand-authored file at `customPath`).",
    "`contentSlug` (defaults to id) names the upstream `src/data/roadmaps/<slug>/content` folder used to fill empty resource lists and to recover unlinked skills.",
    "Bump `commit`, add/remove entries, then run `pnpm run sync:disciplines && pnpm run data:check`."
